==Unique modifiers==
{{SVersion|1.32}}
There are some modifiers that are used within event modifiers only:

<pre>
religion = yes
secondary_religion = yes
</pre>

When added to an event modifier, these will cause the event modifier to disappear if the country changes religion (or syncretic religion).

===Unit Scope===
The event modifier with these modifiers is set to Unit Scope. These are also used for estate privileges and parliament issues.
Without correct DLC this part is ignored and the event modifiers become a normal global modifier.

